Healthy responses: enrollment succeeds; session scheduler authenticates.
HTTP 503 controls: enrollment rejects with network; session scheduler reports error.
Stalled HTTP responses: both requests reached the local server; no application abort signal supplied.
At 2000 ms: enrollment=pending; session=authenticating; shell=loading (Signing in).
Harness cancellation: enrollment rejects; session exits authenticating into error.
PARTIAL ONLY: no Android runtime, TLS, cellular path, or Chrome comparison exercised.
